  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful apps in WinForms, .NET, C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\n⚡ENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Button Textbox\n# Siticone Button Advanced\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n\n# Siticone Line Chart Advanced\n# Siticone Pie Chart\n# Siticone Bar Chart\n# Siticone Doughnut Chart\n# Siticone Radar Chart\n# Siticone Heatmap Chart\n# Siticone Funnel Chart\n# Siticone Waterfall Chart\n# Siticone Bubble Chart\n# Siticone Gantt Chart\n# Siticone Treemap Chart\n# Siticone Sunburst Chart\n# Siticone Box Plot Chart\n# Siticone Candlestick Chart\n# Siticone Scanner\n# Siticone Fading ListView\n# Siticone Avatar\n# Siticone Toggle Switch Advanced\n# Siticone Scan Button\n# Siticone H Slider2\n# Siticone V Slider2\n# Siticone V Range Slider2\n# Siticone H Range Slider2\n# Siticone H 4Range Slider\n# Siticone V 4Range Slider\n# Siticone H 6Range Slider\n# Siticone V 6Range Slider\n# Siticone Clock Advanced\n# Siticone Ruler\n# Siticone Ruler 2\n# Siticone Wallpaper Panel\n# Siticone Play Button\n# Siticone Material Close Button\n# Siticone Password Strength Indicator\n# Siticone Currency Textbox\n# Siticone File Picker\n# Siticone Folder Picker\n# Siticone Activity Indicator Adv\n# Siticone Graphical Activity Log",
